// Sandy Cove: a beach at low tide. The beacon stands halfway along a sandbar, a yard one tile
// wide and five long, so whoever holds it can be come at from either side; sea-worn rocks
// break up the sand either side of it, and the bar's two ends run out into the rocks.
id: cove
name: Sandy Cove
